  saída do cast: Error: Failed to estimate gas: server returned an error response: error code 3: execution reverted: custom error 0x52c00efe: 00000000000000000000000070997970c51812dc3a010c7d01b50e0d17dc79c8, data: "0x52c00efe00000000000000000000000070997970c51812dc3a010c7d01b50e0d17dc79c8": SomenteDono(0x70997970C51812dc3A010C7d01b50e0d17dc79C8)
  [ok] bibliotecária tenta se autopromover a dono das permissões -> revert SomenteDono
